          I design and build digital experiences,
          interfaces and full-stack products with
          a focus on detail, performance and simplicity.
        </p>

        <div
          class="flex translate-y-4 justify-start opacity-0 animate-[fadeUp_0.8s_ease-out_0.7s_forwards] sm:justify-end"
        >
          <a
            href="#projects"
